      "notes": "Q2 2026 13F (filed 2026-08-14 by parent Pershing Square Inc.): $19.5B in 15 rows. Q1 2026 13F: $13.7B in 11 positions — Pershing Square runs one of the most concentrated activist books on Wall Street. Famous big bets include the Herbalife short, the FNMA/FMCC preferreds, and a major stake in Fannie Mae bonds. Public letters often precede activist campaigns.",
