      "infoText": "Founder and CEO of Pershing Square Capital Management (founded 2004). Runs one of the most concentrated activist books on Wall Street — typically 10–15 positions. Known for the Herbalife short (eventually closed at a loss), the FNMA/FMCC preferreds bet, and ahead-of-the-news public letters. Since Q2 2026 the 13F is filed by the public parent, Pershing Square Inc. (NYSE: PS), which consolidates the fund’s book with the parent’s own direct holdings.",
